# Example .env file for local development.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (same directory, repo root) and fill in real
# values. `.env` is loaded automatically at process startup by
# cmd/server, cmd/worker, and cmd/migrate (see internal/platform/config.LoadDotEnv)
# BEFORE bootstrap config.toml + its own env var overlay run, so anything
# set here is visible to that existing os.LookupEnv-based override logic.
#
# `.env` itself is gitignored — never commit real secrets. This file only
# holds placeholder values and is safe to commit.

# --- Bootstrap config overrides (internal/platform/config/bootstrap.go Env* consts) ---
# Override the Postgres DSN from config.toml/defaults.
# APP_POSTGRES_DSN=postgres://fisher:fisher@localhost:5432/fisher_mapper?sslmode=disable

# Override the Redis address from config.toml/defaults.
# APP_REDIS_ADDR=localhost:6379

# Override the HTTP listen port from config.toml/defaults.
# APP_HTTP_PORT=8080

# Override the gRPC listen port from config.toml/defaults (Fase 6,
# cmd/server -- served in the same process as HTTP, as a second oklog/run
# actor, see lifecycle.GRPCServerActor).
# APP_GRPC_PORT=9090

# Override the minimum log level from config.toml/defaults.
# APP_LOG_LEVEL=info

# Override the service name from config.toml/defaults (cmd/worker suffixes
# this with "-worker" rather than needing its own override).
# APP_SERVICE_NAME=fisher-mapper

# Override the rate-limiter's token-bucket rate/burst from config.toml/defaults.
# APP_RATELIMIT_RATE_PER_SECOND=20
# APP_RATELIMIT_BURST=40

# --- Bootstrap config file path override (cmd/server, cmd/worker, cmd/migrate) ---
# Path to the bootstrap config.toml file, if not the repo-root default.
# APP_CONFIG_FILE=config.toml

# --- Fase 5 observability (cmd/worker/main.go) ---
# Port for cmd/worker's GET /metrics (Prometheus). Deliberately NOT part of
# config.Bootstrap/config.toml -- that struct is shared by cmd/server (which
# serves /metrics on cfg.HTTP.Port instead, no extra port needed) and
# cmd/worker (no HTTP port of its own); a single shared port field would
# collide when both processes run on the same host, which the Makefile's
# `make run` / `make run-worker` do by default.
# APP_WORKER_METRICS_PORT=9101

# --- Secrets (internal/platform/secrets/env: Secrets.GetSecret uses Prefix + strings.ToUpper(key)) ---
# Admin API key required by /admin/config endpoints (cmd/server/main.go).
# Left unset, every /admin/config request is rejected (fails closed).
ADMIN_API_KEY=changeme-admin-key

# Shared HMAC secret for the mock PJP's outbound signing / inbound webhook
# verification (internal/platform/bootstrap/register.go). Left unset, POST
# /webhooks/mock rejects every request (fails closed).
PROVIDER_MOCK_SECRET=changeme-mock-secret

# --- Test-only (not read by the app itself; used by `make test-db` / integration tests) ---
# Postgres DSN used by DB-gated integration tests when set. Unset -> those
# tests skip themselves.
# TEST_POSTGRES_DSN=postgres://fisher:fisher@localhost:5432/fisher_mapper?sslmode=disable
